# ============================================================
# Tauri desktop wrapper (Rust build artifacts + generated sidecar binaries)
# ============================================================
desktop/src-tauri/target/
# Sidecar binaries are produced by `dotnet publish` during the build; never commit them.
desktop/src-tauri/binaries/*
!desktop/src-tauri/binaries/README.md
# The pinned cloudflared version + checksum manifest IS tracked (used to verify the
# binary fetched at build time). The binaries themselves stay ignored.
!desktop/src-tauri/binaries/cloudflared-versions.json
# The pinned OCR asset version + checksum manifest IS tracked (used to verify the
# tessdata model + optional native libs fetched at build time). The fetched
# tessdata/* and ocr-native/* binaries themselves stay ignored under binaries/*.
!desktop/src-tauri/binaries/ocr-assets-versions.json
# Generated Tauri gen/ (schemas, Android/iOS scaffolding) — recreated by the CLI.
desktop/src-tauri/gen/
# Vendored at build time from the frontend's qrcode dependency (next to the
# wrapper's QR page in public/desktop and copied into dist/desktop).
src/frontend/aircane-web/public/desktop/qrcode.min.js
src/frontend/aircane-web/dist/desktop/qrcode.min.js

# ============================================================
# Kiro
# ============================================================
.kiro/

# Agent workflow scaffolding (task tracking, design notes, review verdicts)
# and transient git worktrees — never commit these.
.agents/
.worktrees/

