# ============================================================
*.bak
*.tmp
*.log

# ============================================================
# OCR local tuning artifacts (privacy — NFR-4)
# ============================================================
# The owner-supplied DnD Beyond character PDF is a LOCAL tuning artifact only.
# It carries real personal data and must NEVER be committed, copied into a
# tracked fixtures dir, or asserted on. Committed OCR fixtures are synthetic.
sshiers_6285266.pdf
# Local real-PDF OCR tuning findings (DPI/PSM only, no personal values) stay local.
verification-ocr.md
